+       us auto-repeats for as long as it is held, every repeat looks exactly
+       like a new press, and the first one would resume the emulator a
+       millisecond after it stopped. Releases do not repeat. The stray key-up
+       belonging to the press that paused us arrives with this still false and
+       is ignored, whether or not the entry flush below already ate it. */
+    bool keen_pause_armed = false;
 
